          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The USS Abraham Lincoln departed California in November for the South China Sea before being redirected to the Middle East ahead of attacks on Iran in February.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cyvl2d5j52lo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Connecticut Senator Richard Blumenthal wrote a letter to Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth detailing reported supply shortages, water contamination, and deteriorating mental health aboard the USS Abraham Lincoln.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cyvl2d5j52lo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Arizona Senator Ruben Gallego requested that a bipartisan congressional delegation be allowed to visit the USS Abraham Lincoln to conduct an oversight investigation.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cyvl2d5j52lo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "CBS News reported that a sailor went overboard from the USS Abraham Lincoln in early August, was rescued by helicopter, treated, and transferred off the ship.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cyvl2d5j52lo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "A relative of a sailor aboard the USS Abraham Lincoln stated that the sailor had lost 29kg (65lbs) since beginning deployment.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cyvl2d5j52lo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "A US Navy official told the BBC that traditional supply hubs were disrupted by combat actions in the region.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cyvl2d5j52lo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The USS Abraham Lincoln originally departed San Diego on November 21 and arrived in the Middle East in January ahead of the US-Israel conflict with Iran that began on February 28.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "Livemint",
          "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/us-news/uss-abraham-lincoln-s-long-iran-mission-sparks-alarm-hegseth-rejects-reports-of-poor-conditions-of-sailors-11786656139223.html",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The aircraft carrier USS George Washington is travelling toward the Indian Ocean to replace the USS Abraham Lincoln in the Middle East.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Livemint",
          "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/us-news/uss-abraham-lincoln-s-long-iran-mission-sparks-alarm-hegseth-rejects-reports-of-poor-conditions-of-sailors-11786656139223.html",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Senator Richard Blumenthal gave Pentagon leadership a deadline of August 27 to respond to six questions regarding Navy fatigue and morale tracking.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/13/uss-abraham-conditions-hegseth",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Annabelle Loma told the Navy Times that her husband, who is serving on the USS Abraham Lincoln, attempted to go overboard during his deployment.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/13/uss-abraham-conditions-hegseth",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Around 200 relatives confronted acting Navy Secretary Hung Cao and senior commanders during a meeting in San Diego regarding the extended deployment of the USS Abraham Lincoln.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Times of India",
          "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/us-rushes-new-carrier-to-middle-east-amid-reports-of-mental-health-crisis-on-uss-lincoln/articleshow/133223354.cms",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The USS Abraham Lincoln made a brief port call in Oman in early July, where crew members stocked up on fresh produce while restricted to a secure compound.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "DW World",
          "url": "https://www.dw.com/en/us-disputes-reports-of-trying-conditions-on-carrier-in-gulf/a-78359084?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "US President Donald Trump claimed online that the US Navy has 'total control' over the Strait of Hormuz.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "DW World",
          "url": "https://www.dw.com/en/us-disputes-reports-of-trying-conditions-on-carrier-in-gulf/a-78359084?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        }
